	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Come holla at me when you ready.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Hall Multi Battle\nchallenge need both partners to roll\fin with the same kinda homie.\rTalk it out with your homie and\npick the same kinda homie.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CHALLENGE</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You eat your fave food first or\nsave it for last?\rAt the Battle Hall, it’s better to\nstart with the types your homies\fdon’t like. Why?\r’cause the other side level up\nas you keep goin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That fancy stage!\rWin streaks get kept for each\nkinda homie.\fEvery homie can make it up there.\rAin’t it beautiful that you can\ngo for the top with\fANY homie?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Slow...\rMy SLOWBRO a cutie, but he done\nscrapped the Brain here.\rThe Brain take your homies on at\nthe same level, to keep it fair.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">SLOWBRO: ...Slow?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Here’s a tip!\rTry the Battle Hall with\nnot just your fave homie,\rbut different kinds of homies\nif you tryna build your\foverall record too.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">At the Battle Hall, if it’s the same\nkinda homie, you can roll in\fdifferent ones and keep your record.\rMaybe have different ones\nthat know different move types.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know how HOPPIP got two types--\nGrass and Flying?\rThat mean it can show up as a\nGrass type AND a Flying type.\rMe?\rYou could think of me as...\na “Lighthearted” type and\fa “Baddie” type, I guess.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A lil advice...\rAt the Battle Hall, the other side’s\nhomies match your level.\rThat way, you can pick any of your\nhomies without trippin’ about\ftheir levels.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Battle Hall keep your\nwin-streak records.\fThat’s dope, huh?\r...Wait a sec!\rMe and my homie can start runs\nwith the same setup and see who\fcan stretch their win streak\fthe longest.\fThat’s even MORE fun!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00068" index="68">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I keep track of the total wins from\nyour longest Single Battle\fwin streaks at the Battle Hall.\rBasically, I add up just the longest\nstreaks for each kinda homie.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When your total win-streak record\nhit certain numbers, you get BP\fas a reward.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your total win-streak\nrecord is {STRVAR_1 55, 1, 0} right now.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00070" index="70">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Your total win-streak record\nhit {STRVAR_1 55, 2, 0}.\fHere go your BP.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00071" index="71">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">When your total win-streak record\nhit {STRVAR_1 55, 3, 0}, you get BP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00072" index="72">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} got {STRVAR_1 53, 4, 0} BP!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00073" index="73">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your total win-streak\nrecord sittin’ at {STRVAR_1 55, 1, 0}.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00074" index="74">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, your total win-streak\nrecord sittin’ at {STRVAR_1 55, 1, 0}.\r...Good gracious!\nThat record is CRAZY!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00075" index="75">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: The Battle Hall been kinda\nborin’ lately.\rAin’t been no fire challengers\nwho can get the crowd goin’.\rSomebody who can beat the\nBrain... Ain’t there NOBODY?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00076" index="76">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: Lemme take a wild guess.\nYou gettin’ into the Battle Hall?\fIt’s addictive, huh?\rThe more you win, the more kinds of\nhomies you get to see, too.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00077" index="77">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: ...\n...Oh, my bad for starin’!\rI saw you on stage last time.\nYou got that star quality.\rI’mma keep my eye on you.\nYou got that aura.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00078" index="78">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: I watch you every time\nyou hit the stage.\rYou fun to watch, lemme tell you.\rNow I’m always lookin’ forward to\nseein’ you and your\fhomies on stage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00079" index="79">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: Ayo, there!\nWhat you finna do this time?\rWhich homie you goin’ for a\nrecord with next?\rWhen I start thinkin’ about that,\nI get too hype to sleep at night.\rThat’s why I been sleepin’ in lately!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00080" index="80">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: Awesome!\nSeriously awesome!\fYou BEYOND awesome!\rThe love you show so many homies...\nThat ain’t easy, I can tell ya!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00081" index="81">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: I ain’t never seen homies\nscrap as fun as yours do.\rYou the first of your kind for me\nas Hustlers go.\rYou know, I brag about you to anybody\nwho’ll listen.\rI been sayin’ you gon’ be a\nstar before you even had a record!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00082" index="82">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: Go, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, go!\nGo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, go!\rI’m makin’ up some dance moves and\ncheers I can do to hype you up.\rIf you wanna see ’em, you gotta\nkeep runnin’ up your records!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00083" index="83">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: You phenomenal.\nAll the scraps you had on stage...\fAll them glory moments...\rYour star burn SO bright!\nI can barely open my eyes around you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00084" index="84">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Winston: The love for homies you\nshowed at the Battle Hall is as\fdeep as it is wide...\rYou can count on me, Winston, to be\nyour lifelong fan.\rJust like you love homies, I love you\nas the homie superstar!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00085" index="85">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: It’s about the Battle Hall...\nIt ain’t excited me lately.\rAin’t been no gorgeous\nchallenger who can sheesh me.\rSomebody who can make me\na fan... Ain’t there NOBODY?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00086" index="86">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’Scuse me?\rIf you don’t mind me askin’, you\ngettin’ into the Battle Hall?\rIt’s fun in a addictive way, right?\nYou know what?\rThe more you win, the more kinds\nof homies show up.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00087" index="87">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’Scuse me?\rI watched you when you was on stage.\nIt gave me butterflies seein’ you.\rUm... You don’t mind if I cheer for\nyou from now on, do you? Please?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00088" index="88">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’Scuse me?\rI cheer for you the best I can.\rI can’t get on stage with you, but\nI wanna show love to your\fhomies and you for goin’ so hard.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00089" index="89">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’Scuse me?\rCan you tell me which homie\nyou goin’ for a record with next?\rWhen I start thinkin’ about that,\nI get all choked up.\rThen I can’t sleep at night\nwhen I get like that.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00090" index="90">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Um... ’Scuse me?\rFantastic! It’s fantastic!\nYou fabulously fantastic!\rThe love you show so many homies...\nThat must take crazy effort.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00091" index="91">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: I ain’t never seen homies\nscrap as fun as yours do.\rYou the first Hustler ever who\ndid that.\rI... I brag on you to all my homies.\nI hope that’s OK.\rI tell ’em I wish I could be as\nwonderful a Hustler as you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00092" index="92">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: Hooray, hooray, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nGo, homies, go!\r...Oh! Um... ’Scuse me.\rI been workin’ on cheers and a\ndance routine for you.\rB-but, I’m sorry for bein’ so silly\nand giddy and...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00093" index="93">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: You inspire me SO much.\rAll the glory you earned scrappin’\nso much on that shinin’ stage...\rJust seein’ you make me feel all\nhappy inside. ♫</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00094" index="94">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Serena: The love you showed homies\nat the Battle Hall is as\fdeep as it is wide...\rIt’s amazin’, you love every kind\nof homie out there.\rI love you for bein’ so amazin’\nand dedicated!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00095" index="95">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lyra: Ayo, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}.\nI love watchin’ you scrap here.\r’Cause...\nyou have fun whether you win\for lose!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00096" index="96">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ethan: The Battle Hall is fire for\nhomie fans like me!\rI get to see so many kinds of\nhomies I ain’t never seen.\rIt’s SO hard!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00097" index="97">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Mom: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI couldn’t help checkin’ up on you!\rEverybody goin’ hard, but I gotta\nsay you look happier than\fanybody else!\rOh, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, that’s right!\rI should hit the Department Store\nin Goldenrod and cop some useful\fstuff for you on the way home!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00098" index="98">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Professor Oak: You keep shockin’ me\nover and over.\rWhat a Hustler you turned out to be!\rIt ain’t enough that you caught\nmore homies than anybody can believe.\rThat alone is crazy enough.\nBut you bonded and scrapped with\f’em too.\rI’m SO proud to know you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0108_D32R0401_00099" index="99">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whitney: I love flashy events like\nthe Battle Hall.\rI ain’t sayin’ I wanna stand out\nin the crowd...\rI just love seein’ cute homies\ngettin’ all the attention!</language>
	</row>
</body>
